From 187d5bdf2c7a8e229f96164a76a6c83ded9d810b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:09:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Derive contract ownership keys from position rows only when
 the rows determine them

One module maps ownership_positions to contract keys for coverage and export:
- investor-class keys (foreign, institutional, retail, insider) need a class-total row,
  or a holder list every row of which the source marks complete; named holders alone
  never stand in for the class;
- strategic_ownership sums strategic holder types in a partition that reconciles to
  100% and has no pooled row that could hide a strategic stake; government stays separate;
- top 5/10 concentration needs N named holders that no pooled row can outrank;
- major_holder_change is the change of one holder at or above 5% between the two latest dates;
- ownership_concentration stays pending until its measure is defined.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CfTpoii6QDStyTPdotmEdY
